WEBVTT

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.180
You're...

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.350
-I'm--
-Don't speak.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:30.990
You people are from the Shingyoto-ryu dojo...

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:34.280
Leader of the Itto-ryu, Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.740
I will be claiming your life.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:41.000
Are you sure?
Those who know my name and point their blades at me

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.330
also point that blade
at my thousand wayward followers.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:52.420
I take you as those who are willing to obstruct
the path of my late grandfather and my future.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.760
May you become dust on the roadside,

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.550
and let it be known to you the weight of my blade.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.560
Blade of the Immortal

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.070
One, two, three

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.150
Undead tree

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.740
What truth

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.580
I'll come true

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:27.460
Wow

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:31.630
I see that bright light

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:38.090
This is all I have

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:42.520
What did you say?
I know

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.020
Why do you say?

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:52.530
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:59.070
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:03.740
I got lost
I was lost

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:07.330
Survive of vision

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:10.750
Unfinished heaven

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:14.590
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:18.340
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:23.100
Survive of vision

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:41.160
Hey! Hold on!

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:04.720
Don't.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.560
A swordsman must know her own strength.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:18.990
Why were you being chased?

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:22.360
Why must I give you an answer?

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:27.750
It was about the Itto-ryu, so I'm sure you were
just planning on crushing some dojo.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.710
It is not nearly so simple.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:37.050
This all started with a request from a dojo in Kaga
to join with the Itto-ryu.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:40.130
Unfortunately, the Shogunate decided to butt in.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:44.050
That dojo was trampled by the Shogunate.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.560
The head and his daughter both committed suicide.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:53.100
Their followers have decided that I am the
root of this evil, and have come to take my head.

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:55.980
In other words, it was all a trap.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:57.230
They're right.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.110
You are the root of this evil.

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:02.110
That's right.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.780
Yes. It is my fault.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:08.160
Either way, with them taking measures
all the way out in Kaga,

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:11.330
I would not be surprised
if something were happening in Edo.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:13.170
I must hurry.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.880
The Shogunate...

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:17.290
We've been winning a bit too much.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.670
I may have overestimated our strength.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.260
What is your reason for becoming stronger?

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:29.930
It's... It's to kill you, obviously!

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.890
Don't ask me pointless questions!

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:34.770
You will kill me, and then what?

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:38.690
Then what? Then-- I--

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:42.070
Well, there is nothing wrong with that.

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.610
Make sure you don't overdo it.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:49.370
Whatever your goal, if you overstep,
you will be unable to return down the path you came.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:50.870
If you live,

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:54.870
you will eventually marry someone
and have progeny.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:59.920
Even if you're wrong, do not let your children
walk the same path that you did. Understand?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.380
How could I understand?

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:06.220
You're the one that caused me to choose this path!

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:09.350
As if I would listen to your logic.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:14.980
Why was it necessary to kill
my father and mother?

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:18.360
If that-- If only that hadn't happened.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.940
It seems I've wronged you.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.450
What did you say?

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:30.950
You, Kagehisa Anotsu!

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.080
Don't make light of me!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:40.000
If you were just going to apologize, why even...

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:50.140
We'll leave here once the rain stops.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.810
If you're done, you should sleep.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.860
Wait.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:14.290
What is it? Are you exhausted?

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:17.370
Even if I were, I wouldn't tell you.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.500
More importantly,

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:22.630
your face looks paler than yesterday.

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:25.840
Does it? It must be your imagination.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:39.980
Can we rest?

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.860
We've come all this way...

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.490
I have some business in this village.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:51.660
Go get some dried sweet potatoes with that money.

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:55.700
And am I to believe you aren't
going to run off on your own?

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.700
I'll leave that with you.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.370
I don't believe they will chase me all the way here,

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.750
but remaining unarmed would be unnerving.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:04.460
Now then.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.300
Wait--

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:07.880
Wait a second!

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:13.390
I heard through the grapevine that you were here.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:22.270
It's been a long time.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:25.190
Have you lost some weight?

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:27.650
You too.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:32.070
No, I am simply gaunt from travel.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:35.580
Won't you rest a while?

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:39.250
There's something I've been wanting to give you
if I ever met you again.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:47.710
It's the remaining sum of money I couldn't repay
when you freed me from bondage.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.800
What are you doing now?

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:56.720
Transportation is what supports the living
in this village.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:00.180
I've been making back supports
for carriers to use.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.770
I make my living by selling those.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:04.690
And?

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:08.320
A trade like that doesn't bring in this kind of money.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:09.900
Tell me what else is going on.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:18.200
I've been selling my body to those carriers
as well as farmers in order to make more money.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.410
And your hand?

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.830
I tried helping with the shifting cultivation.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.630
But I couldn't get the hang of it--

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.090
Makie...

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.810
Have you gone mad?

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:45.730
What will come from doing this?
If you get gangrene from this, you will never--

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.610
That would be fine with me.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:50.900
No, in fact that should happen.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:57.320
Sir Kagehisa, I've failed at living as well as dying.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:01.660
At letting live, at killing, at hating, at forgiving...
All of it...

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.900
-Have you fed yourself?
-I have.

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.200
Here's your portion. Want it?

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:50.790
Can we...take a break soon?

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:52.920
That's not even a question.

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:55.840
We're hurrying to Takayama.

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:02.260
Hey! What's wrong?

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:09.860
Tetanus? How?

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:12.320
I can't say I don't have a hunch.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:15.030
What? You mean from two days ago?

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:17.400
But you were only grazed.

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.870
A sword or spear
that's been submersed in manure overnight

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:26.410
becomes a terrifying weapon that can carry any number
of diseases into a target's body with just a scratch.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.330
They wanted to make sure

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:30.630
they slowed me down, no matter what.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:33.380
What should we do? Return to Shirakawa?

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.760
Don't be foolish!

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:38.840
I'm getting a bad feeling.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.760
I must return quickly, if even only a day sooner.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:45.850
Besides, isn't this a good thing? For you, that is.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.020
This is a chance you'll never have again.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.900
Don't worry.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:54.690
When I do kill you, I'll be sure to do it properly
with my own hands.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:57.990
I'll decide when and how I want to kill you.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.040
Are you okay?

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.920
Having you worry over me
makes me feel especially useless.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.340
Yeah, I'm sure it does.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.250
So, hey.

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:18.800
Could it be that even speaking is difficult for you?

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.510
You can tell?

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:23.850
As tetanus progresses,
your mouth and tongue start to go.

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:27.680
Eventually, I'll be unable to hold a conversation.

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:30.560
What are you--?

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:33.020
Lower your body and take a look down there.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.190
Should we hide and let them pass?

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.820
No, it's no use.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:45.780
They've likely sent men to all the paths,
prepared to chase me all the way to Edo.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.950
If it will eventually come to a battle,

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:52.040
it has to be now while I can still move my body.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.330
Can you win right now?

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.090
I'm not sure.

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.510
But there is a path to victory.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:08.270
What is it, girl?

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:10.810
Perform, Golden Bugs!

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:17.270
What happened?

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.900
-He circled that way!
-Wait!

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:27.620
Let's go.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:30.950
Kagehisa Anotsu!

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.170
If not for you...

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:35.460
why did the Shingyoto-ryu

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:40.300
have to get caught up in the Shogunate's scheme?

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:44.680
Why? Answer me, Kagehisa Anotsu...

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.850
It's quite a surprise.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:49.760
What is?

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:54.520
That you agreed to this fighting style
with cheap gimmicks.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.310
If I had been killed by them,

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:00.530
you wouldn't have been caught in any trouble.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:03.450
It really is true. Why is that?

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:05.820
But I think...

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:10.200
If you had been killed in a way unrelated
to my situation,

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.830
it may have upset me in a way.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.710
You're a curse of a woman.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.590
Welcome, all who have gathered.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:24.720
To you members of the Itto-ryu especially, well met.

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:26.840
I am the new head,

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:29.930
Kagimura Habaki.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:33.310
On this occasion, the imperial guard in its entirety

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:36.730
is truly indebted to you for your gracious support

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:41.980
of the foundation of this official sword academy.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:44.990
Please accept this banquet
as a token of our gratitude.

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:51.700
I would be honored if you would drink and eat your fill,
and fuel the will and body of a savage swordsman.

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.330
That is all.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.290
Hey, rich man.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.460
Mr. Abayama, money is nice,

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:02.170
but was it all right to forget about Anotsu?

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.380
Don't let it bother you.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.510
It's his own fault.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.390
He said he'd come back on a certain day, but didn't.

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:11.640
I see.

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:18.140
I'm really getting tired of having to tell these newbies.

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:19.940
Even I have--

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.110
What is that?

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:25.530
A mushroom and fern fish salad.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:28.820
I see. And then--
Where are you off to?

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:31.160
Pardon me, I must use the lavatories.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.880
In half an hour on the dot.

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:52.140
"Why... won't...

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.350
you... just...

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:58.020
kill...

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:00.440
me?"

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:02.150
"Why won't you just kill me?"

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:05.610
Yeah. I guess you're right.

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:10.110
Killing someone who can't even stand
with their own strength is just...

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.620
a job more unpleasant than I'd imagined.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:20.670
-Here, take this.
-Thank you very much.

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:38.520
Sorry!

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:41.230
Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:44.650
You may be ill, but what's with that glare?

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:49.530
Why did this have to happen
to our master and his daughter? I want to know.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:51.660
Or I wanted to know!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:56.280
But it doesn't matter anymore. No matter the explanation
that accompanies your answer,

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:59.450
I have no intention of letting you live.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:02.710
I will simply kill you. Draw your sword.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.380
Listen, you guys!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.880
He can barely even stand!

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:09.510
-And against all of you?
-Hey, keep quiet, girl.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:11.420
I don't know what happened,

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:14.640
but this doesn't amount to a warrior's fight!

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.270
Ganging up on him like this...

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:23.810
That's enough. Kill the kid. I'm getting sick of it.

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.610
I'll put an end to everything,

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.190
Kagehisa Anotsu!

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.030
Oh? Hey, Rin!

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:34.780
Mr. Manji?

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:41.450
Mr. Manji, Mr. Manji.

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:42.660
Mr. Manji, please!

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:44.620
Kill everyone here

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:46.460
right now!

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.340
Mr. Manji! Mr. Manji!

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:51.760
Do it, kill them!

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:58.260
My, oh my, just when I think I've caught you,
I find you in a predicament like this...

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:03.310
Rin, let me ask you something.
Are these guys Itto-ryu?

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:05.230
No.

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:06.520
I see.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:10.730
Rin. I'm sorry, but I guess you can call this
an oath in front of a grave.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:17.700
Even if I'm shouldering someone's revenge,
I can't just go killing every other person that passes by.

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:21.700
So right now I'm going to trust what you say.

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:25.750
Are these guys deserving of death by me?

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:26.670
Mr. Manji.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.380
How about it, Rin?

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:32.960
I don't know. I don't know!

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:40.560
I'm an idiot, so I make decisions
that I can't take back.

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:45.770
So this is the only thing I know right now.

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:51.730
If you don't kill them now,
I know for sure that they'll come back to kill me!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:59.240
You haven't grown a bit. Look at you,
crying like a little baby.

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:01.870
There's no need to think so hard about it.

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.910
That's all I was asking

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.500
from the very start.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.080
You would stand in our way?

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:17.010
Now, you've gone too far,
putting your hands on someone's girl.

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:19.470
I'll slice you all to shreds!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:21.300
Tono! Taki!

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:23.640
Stay back. Leave this to us.

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:27.390
The one you guys should be killing
is Anotsu over there!

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:31.730
That's...?

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:34.730
Mr. Manji!

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:48.370
Mr. Manji, that's payment for my medical fees.

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.330
Who are you?

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:53.290
Itto-ryu, Taito Magatsu.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:54.750
-What did you say?
-Itto-ryu?

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:57.130
Oops, should I not have said that?

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:01.390
Kagehisa Anotsu, my patience has run out.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:04.310
I won't suffer any more interlopers!

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:08.600
From the start, this was about taking your life alone
for me.

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:10.140
Now I'll end this.

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:11.860
Hey, wait a sec--

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:29.000
You take care of the woman. Tono, Taki.
You two will fight that man.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.210
Stand up, Iriya!

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:33.080
Hold it!

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:21.260
All that's left is you.

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:24.090
Curses!

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:33.730
Face me, Kagehisa Anotsu!

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:38.020
I didn't come here to be killed by her!

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:40.820
You! I have to fight you!

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:45.370
Kagehisa Anotsu!

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:49.330
Use that.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:51.200
That's your sword too.

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:13.180
You...

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:27.660
You really put on a show, lady.

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:37.330
Kagehisa Anotsu!

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:40.460
A pitiable man.

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:45.090
Your belief that what you were doing right
had been challenged, just like this.

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:48.890
But don't forget what you said to me because of this.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.850
I won't let you forget.

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:53.810
No matter how many die for you,

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:56.190
no matter how many times your trust is betrayed,

00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:58.860
go and break the boundaries
of what a sword school should be!

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:03.530
Go on believing in that Sengoku era dream forever.
Just like this!

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:08.110
Wherever the Itto-ryu stands at the end of it,

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:09.530
I'll be waiting.

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:14.250
Will you resist, or wither away?
Then, when you've found the answer,

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:16.040
I...

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:18.620
will come to kill you.

00:22:18.710 --> 00:22:20.210
I swear.

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:22.250
Remember that.

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:27.630
Was that really okay?

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:34.430
What is it?

00:22:34.520 --> 00:22:36.020
I'll pass.

00:22:36.100 --> 00:22:41.020
Stupid, I'd like to eat, take a bath and go to sleep
sooner rather than later!

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:43.570
I'm faster. Enough prattling.

00:22:45.570 --> 00:22:49.110
-Have you gotten lighter?
-Yeah.

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:51.530
I used the Golden Bugs,

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:53.280
and all my money is gone.

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:56.700
What have you been getting into, kid?

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:01.130
Hey, Mr. Manji...

00:23:52.220 --> 00:23:54.800
Act Twelve – Blood of Finality
